{
  "technical_and_design_decisions": [
    "Use Go language as per Hyperledger Fabric core and GoDoc requirements.",
    "Extend existing Fabric configuration libraries (e.g., common/tools/configtxgen or common/config) rather than creating a new standalone system.",
    "Utilize existing Fabric protobuf definitions for Config, ConfigUpdate, and FabricMSPConfig structures.",
    "Implement certificate validation using the standard Go crypto/x509 package for the KeyUsageCertSign/CA attribute checks."
  ],
  "assumptions": [
    "Developer has access to the Hyperledger Fabric codebase and test environments.",
    "Workdays are standard 8-hour days.",
    "No UI development is required; this is a backend library increment.",
    "Existing Fabric testing utilities can be leveraged for unit tests and examples.",
    "The developer is familiar with Hyperledger Fabric internals and the channel configuration update workflow."
  ],
  "activities": [
    {
      "activity_id": "A1",
      "activity_name": "Setup and Codebase Analysis",
      "activity_description": "Review existing config/MSP code, understand the config update workflow, and set up the development environment for the new library functions.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A2",
      "activity_name": "Anchor Peer Management (U1, U2, U7)",
      "activity_description": "Implement functions to add, remove, and retrieve anchor peers for a specific org from an existing channel configuration. Compute the resulting ConfigUpdate transaction.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A3",
      "activity_name": "MSP Certificate Revocation (U3)",
      "activity_description": "Implement the function to revoke a certificate issued by an MSP by modifying the revocation_list attribute of FabricMSPConfig and generating a ConfigUpdate transaction.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A4",
      "activity_name": "MSP Root CA Addition (U4)",
      "activity_description": "Implement the function to add a new root CA certificate to an MSP configuration. Include minimal validation to reject certificates missing the KeyUsageCertSign/CA attributes. Generate the ConfigUpdate transaction.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A5",
      "activity_name": "Orderer Configuration Retrieval (U8)",
      "activity_description": "Implement a function to retrieve existing orderer configuration without manual parsing, returning a config.Orderer object that can be modified and passed to config.UpdateOrdererConfiguration.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.0
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A6",
      "activity_name": "Documentation and Examples (U5, U6)",
      "activity_description": "Write GoDoc examples demonstrating idiomatic usage of the package to create configuration updates (with multiple changes) and new channel create transactions, including signing the config update envelope.",
      "most_likely_effort": 1.5
    },
    {
      "activity_id": "A7",
      "activity_name": "Testing and Refactoring",
      "activity_description": "Write unit tests for all new functions, update example tests to demonstrate usage of the new helpers (U7, U8), and perform code refactoring for integration.",
      "most_likely_effort": 2.0
    }
  ],
  "reported_total": {
    "most_likely_effort": 10.5
  }
}
```

